{"unit_id":"bass1125__imemory#card-zh","repo":"bass1125/imemory","commit":"dc3d5e8f82368cf30847f3469add98034d9a5e1e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"imemory 是一款面向 DSH 各类客户端的长期记忆插件：它在对话回合结束后提取可复用信息，在模型步骤前检索并注入相关记忆，也提供会话开场记忆。它通过六个 memory 工具管理笔记和用户档案，并可将操作流程沉淀为技能；web profile 还可使用记忆管理面板浏览、调整和整理条目。适合希望跨会话保留事实、偏好和工作流程的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH 提供文件与模型服务；记忆保存在本机配置目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["imemory.mjs:651-713","imemory.mjs:833-947","imemory.mjs:951-1123","imemory.mjs:1124-1246"]}
{"unit_id":"bass1125__imemory#card-en","repo":"bass1125/imemory","commit":"dc3d5e8f82368cf30847f3469add98034d9a5e1e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"imemory is a DSH plugin that extracts lasting details after turns and recalls relevant notes before model steps. Six tools manage notes and profiles; workflows can become skills. Web profiles get a panel to browse and organize entries. It uses DSH file and model services and stores memory locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["imemory.mjs:651-713","imemory.mjs:833-947","imemory.mjs:951-1123","imemory.mjs:1124-1246"]}
