{"unit_id":"bass1125__imemory#feature-1","repo":"bass1125/imemory","commit":"dc3d5e8f82368cf30847f3469add98034d9a5e1e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"imemory 的功能「自动提取记忆」：在根会话回合结束后调用当前模型，从近期对话中提炼持久信息并写入记忆文件；可复用的操作步骤也能沉淀为技能。每轮限制操作数量并过滤低重要度条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["imemory.mjs:651-713"]}
{"unit_id":"bass1125__imemory#feature-2","repo":"bass1125/imemory","commit":"dc3d5e8f82368cf30847f3469add98034d9a5e1e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"imemory 的功能「相关记忆召回」：模型每步开始前先按关键词筛选记忆，候选较多时再用当前模型重排，并把匹配条目注入上下文；没有可用模型时回退到关键词结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["imemory.mjs:392-447","imemory.mjs:871-932"]}
{"unit_id":"bass1125__imemory#feature-3","repo":"bass1125/imemory","commit":"dc3d5e8f82368cf30847f3469add98034d9a5e1e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"imemory 的功能「记忆管理工具」：memory_search、memory_add、memory_update 和 memory_forget 可检索、维护笔记及用户档案，也能搜索会话和整理相似条目。输入查询或条目，返回结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["imemory.mjs:951-1119"]}
{"unit_id":"bass1125__imemory#feature-4","repo":"bass1125/imemory","commit":"dc3d5e8f82368cf30847f3469add98034d9a5e1e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"imemory 的功能「网页记忆面板」：存在 webServer 服务时提供 /imemory/ 页面，可查看笔记、用户档案和学习技能，并调用接口刷新、调整插件记录条目的重要度、删除条目或发起冲突整理。","source":"generated","evidence":["imemory.mjs:1124-1246","imemory.mjs:1270-1335"]}
{"unit_id":"bass1125__imemory#caveat-1","repo":"bass1125/imemory","commit":"dc3d5e8f82368cf30847f3469add98034d9a5e1e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"imemory 使用当前配置模型做记忆提取、语义重排和冲突合并；没有可用模型时，提取与重排功能无法完成，召回可退回关键词排序。","source":"generated","evidence":["imemory.mjs:392-395","imemory.mjs:651-672","imemory.mjs:779-782"]}
